sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Scan as GHA assessment job
    participant Agent as Security Agent API
    participant Check as GHA validation job
    participant Write as GHA publishing job
    participant Git as GitHub repository
    Note over Scan,Agent: Dispatch inputs: mode, target types and base branch<br/>create_remediation_pr defaults to false
    Scan->>Agent: Submit exact source snapshot and requested mode/options
    Agent-->>Scan: Accepted assessment ID
    Agent->>Agent: Publish baseline, then deep advice<br/>and requested patch
    Scan->>Agent: Poll status and retrieve report
    Agent-->>Scan: Findings, coverage and optional patch status/reference
    alt PR requested, deep mode and eligible source edits
        Scan->>Check: Immutable patch digest, base SHA and findings
        Check->>Check: Verify paths/hashes and apply edits<br/>Run bounded static checks
        alt Validation passes and publication authorised
            Check->>Write: Validated candidate identity
            Write->>Git: Recheck base SHA and bot branch/PR state
            alt Base unchanged and no human-edit conflict
                Write->>Git: Push bot branch and create or reconcile draft PR
                Git-->>Write: PR URL
            else Stale base or conflicting state
                Write->>Write: Stop delivery with explicit reason
            end
        else Invalid edits or incomplete required coverage
            Check->>Check: Block PR publication
        end
    else Report-only, no changes or manual remediation
        Scan->>Scan: Record no-PR reason
    end
    Note over Scan,Git: Workflow summary preserves assessment/report and delivery outcome, no automatic merge
